1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:01,130
Shake your phone.

2
00:00:01,130 --> 00:00:02,090
Blurry, right?

3
00:00:02,090 --> 00:00:04,267
Now gently shake your HEAD.

4
00:00:04,320 --> 00:00:05,340
Sharp again?

5
00:00:05,340 --> 00:00:06,184
Your EARS

6
00:00:06,184 --> 00:00:08,367
are steering your eyes.

7
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:09,300
Keep going.

8
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:10,400
Head goes right...

9
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:11,319
your ear rolls

10
00:00:11,319 --> 00:00:13,033
your eyes LEFT.

11
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:14,285
In a HUNDREDTH

12
00:00:14,285 --> 00:00:15,533
of a second!

13
00:00:15,580 --> 00:00:16,630
Shake the phone?

14
00:00:16,630 --> 00:00:18,140
Your ears feel nothing,

15
00:00:18,140 --> 00:00:19,740
so your eyes chase it.

16
00:00:19,740 --> 00:00:20,667
Too slow.

17
00:00:20,721 --> 00:00:22,069
A doctor who lost this

18
00:00:22,069 --> 00:00:23,444
read with his head

19
00:00:23,444 --> 00:00:25,510
jammed between bed bars.

20
00:00:25,510 --> 00:00:26,470
Even his heartbeat

21
00:00:26,470 --> 00:00:28,133
made the words jump.

22
00:00:28,170 --> 00:00:29,260
Still reading?

23
00:00:29,260 --> 00:00:30,629
Nod yes.

